      "cause": "The duplication is CORRELATED with the variable being measured. A large multi-part parcel spans more of the 0.02-degree grid, so it is replicated into more tiles, so its acreage is counted more times. The three most-duplicated geometries alone contributed roughly 67.4 million spurious acres, about 46 percent of the prior 146.9 million total."
